90","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116490","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116490.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116490.patch","merged_at":"2026-07-24T14:25:35Z"},"body":"Extract DocumentList from ScriptEditor\r\n\r\n- Built on https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111309 ( I wouldn't refactor without this due to risk of infinite `tree_changed` signals.)\r\n- Similar to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115346\r\n- Fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121708\r\n\r\nFixed display full paths mode not showing unsaved status.\r\nFixed Online Docs button text not updating when using history arrows\r\nShould work the same otherwise, and should be much easier to work with in the future.\r\n\r\nEditor Settings are now cached instead of gotten each time it updates (sometimes multiple times).\r\nMoved some file menu handling since it was needlessly duplicated.\r\n\r\nRemoved the \"nodes\" drop type, it is unused, it is not possible to drag the EditorHelp or ScriptEditorBase directly (since always I think).\r\nI left the rest of the drag and drop logic unchanged, it can be improved later. There are some pre-existing minor issues like dropping files never goes to the end of the list or sometimes not selecting the right child after dropping.\r\n\r\nMoved the `(*)` unsaved suffix from `get_name` to `update_list`. It had to be trimmed off in most cases, and the other uses are just messages where it isn't needed.\r\nRemoved the `grab_focus_block`, it was not functional and seemed to be hacky. It was probably to prevent the TextEdit from taking the focus if using the keyboard on the script list. If it is wanted, it can be re-implemented later.\r\nMoved various updating logic to `ScriptEditor::ensure_select_current` or `_update_filenames` to have it unified rather than scattered around where sometimes things aren't updated. Now other things aren't updated from the document list update function.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116490/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116490/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}